# Byte-exactness matters in this repository: the verification gate reports exact
# row counts and the artifact files are tracked by hash. Git must not rewrite
# line endings on checkout, on any platform.
#
# `-text` disables all end-of-line conversion: what is committed is what is
# checked out, byte for byte. Every file here is LF and stays LF.
* -text

# Keep GitHub's language stats honest — data and query files are not "code".
*.ttl  linguist-language=Turtle
*.rq   linguist-language=SPARQL
kg/source/**  linguist-generated=true
